<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: =
12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
1. Client onboarding pipeline review.</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: =
12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
2. Release details to be updated on the SC IDP =A8C App/Plugin Teams Releas=
e =A8C 2026 page.</div>
<div style=3D"font-family: Aptos, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: =
12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
